			Child: Barcode
			Child: Table
			Child: Columns
			Child: Frame
			Child: Overlay
			Child: Page overlay
	Node: Page overlay
		Type: GROUP
		Description: Block superimposed on the pages, out of flow: it is placed with Offset in the page area and is repeated on the pages that Pages says (all by default). Headers, footers and watermarks.
